    "description": "Demote Owner out of the primary Deal Information section and make it non-required.\n\n=== IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS ===\n\n* Move Owner into the Additional Details section. Not required.\n\n* Joyce: 'owner and deal version, I was thinking that we would just have it under additional details' -> 'basically, these two things are not required.'\n\n* Drop Deal Version from this card entirely — it's being deleted (BUILD-164), not demoted. The original card title still pairs them.\n\n* Additional Details is the standing bucket for demoted-but-kept fields. Joyce: 'additional details is where I just kind of bucketed all the fields that I think are worth keeping in some form, but we don't need them to be higher up on the page.'\n\n* Consistent with the Operator/Partner treatment, where Owner was removed from the layout entirely — worth checking whether Deal should go the same way rather than just demoting.\n\n=== NOTES ===\n\n* Retitled from 'Make owner and deal version non-required / moved into additional details' because half of it is now a deletion.\n\n=== SOURCE ===\n\n* Aug 11 call — Joyce 47:13-47:55, 51:07\n\n* Aug 17 call — Owner removed on Operator\n\nDependencies: BUILD-164\n\nRemember to update the requirements documentation as part of this change.\n\nPolished 2026-08-17 from the Operator/Partner ticket review, approved by Kobi.",
